      "licence": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
    },
    {
      "id": "C92",
      "text": "The cable was from San Francisco, California along Hawaii, Midway, and Guam to Manila, Philippines, and continued undersea along China and Japan.",
      "class": "CONFIRMED_FACT",
