      "text": "CS Seine, maiden voyage 1873 CS Faraday, built in 1874 for Siemens Brothers CS Gomos, the first cable ship ever to be sunk; she was rammed by another ship in the 1870s while laying a cable for the Brazilian Submarine Telegraph Company.",
